{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33000","headline":"贺雪寄本府尚书 · 曹邺","name":"贺雪寄本府尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨雪不顺时，阴阳失明晦。\n麦根半成土，农夫泣相对。\n我公诚诉天，天地忽已泰。\n长飙卷白云，散落羣峰外。\n拂砌花影明，交宫鹤翎碎。\n宿鸟晨不飞，犹疑月光在。\n碧树香尽发，蠹虫声渐退。\n有客怀兔园，吟诗遶城内。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}